1154	// breakArchiveSave makes the archive commit fail at the save stage: the
1155	// temporary file the atomic writer creates becomes a directory, so opening
1156	// it as a regular file fails while the lock, the archived conclusion, the
1157	// review object and its revisions are all valid. This is a storage failure
1158	// at persistence time, not a validation, version-conflict or busy error.
